  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4eed53444f28c7a448788809f8598a5b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 01_readme
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::OperatorFile
  fileNameEn: README.txt
  fileNamePt: LEIA-ME.txt
  titleEn: Operator instructions
  titlePt: "Instru\xE7\xF5es do operador"
  bodyEn: 'OPERATOR TERMINAL 07 - STANDING INSTRUCTIONS


    1. You are the only
    link between the subject and the outside. Keep the line open.

    2. The subject
    can hear you. Speak clearly. Do not panic her.

    3. Cameras: Q / E. Map: TAB.
    Talk: ENTER.

    4. Never close LIFELINE.EXE while the subject is exposed. Close
    it only when she is in a SAFE ZONE (the save rooms).

    5. The door of this
    room is locked for your own protection.

    6. Coffee is free. Please do not
    ask for anything else.


    - Facility Management'
  bodyPt: "TERMINAL DO OPERADOR 07 - INSTRU\xC7\xD5ES PERMANENTES\n\n1. Voc\xEA \xE9
    a \xFAnica liga\xE7\xE3o entre a pessoa monitorada e o lado de fora. Mantenha
    a linha aberta.\n2. Ela consegue ouvir voc\xEA. Fale com clareza. N\xE3o a deixe
    em p\xE2nico.\n3. C\xE2meras: Q / E. Mapa: TAB. Falar: ENTER.\n4. Nunca feche
    o LIFELINE.EXE com ela exposta. Feche apenas quando ela estiver numa ZONA SEGURA
    (as salas de salvar).\n5. A porta desta sala est\xE1 trancada para a sua pr\xF3pria
    prote\xE7\xE3o.\n6. O caf\xE9 \xE9 de gra\xE7a. Por favor, n\xE3o pe\xE7a mais
    nada.\n\n- Administra\xE7\xE3o das Instala\xE7\xF5es"
  requiredFlag: 
  order: 0
